{"bangumi":{"date":"2020-10-02","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/a4/32/297340_20R22.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/a4/32/297340_20R22.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/a4/32/297340_20R22.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/a4/32/297340_20R22.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/a4/32/297340_20R22.jpg"},"summary":"正和63年10月。因大废线而使铁路消失殆尽的国家——日之本。\r\n九州隈元县御一夜市。为了重振不景气的经济，成功进行了以蒸汽机车8620和铁路人偶八六为主角的观光振兴。作为铁路复兴圣地的这座城市，为了进一步振兴铁路，并促进全国铁路事业者——掌车人们之间的交流，计划举办“第一届掌车人节”。火车的驾驶控制用人型模块“铁路人偶”们也在各自主人的带领下从全国集合起来。受人类连日会议的刺激，她们意气相投地表示“我们也想做些什么”，以知名的铁路人偶“铃白”为中心举行了“铁路人偶峰会”。在站前的“亚麻色咖啡厅”集合，为了给“掌车人节”增添更多色彩而绞尽脑汁。","name":"レヱル・ロマネスク","name_cn":"铁路浪漫谭","tags":[{"name":"泡面番","count":253,"total_count":154411},{"name":"GAL改","count":153,"total_count":78747},{"name":"2020年10月","count":144,"total_count":25394},{"name":"游戏改","count":126,"total_count":163036},{"name":"TV","count":107,"total_count":1407211},{"name":"2020","count":98,"total_count":64048},{"name":"百合","count":74,"total_count":403689},{"name":"萝莉","count":71,"total_count":46067},{"name":"日常","count":61,"total_count":401542},{"name":"艹火车","count":56,"total_count":56},{"name":"サエッタ","count":35,"total_count":107},{"name":"saetta","count":31,"total_count":58},{"name":"泡面","count":29,"total_count":10560},{"name":"轻百合","count":22,"total_count":38417},{"name":"铁路浪漫谭","count":11,"total_count":14},{"name":"日本","count":9,"total_count":298613},{"name":"ひらさわひさよし","count":5,"total_count":37},{"name":"平泽久义","count":3,"total_count":49},{"name":"上坂堇","count":3,"total_count":287},{"name":"火车","count":3,"total_count":14},{"name":"萌","count":3,"total_count":71356},{"name":"治愈","count":3,"total_count":302329},{"name":"元村洸一","count":3,"total_count":3},{"name":"特定人群向","count":2,"total_count":533},{"name":"动画","count":2,"total_count":35749},{"name":"Lose","count":2,"total_count":3},{"name":"爱上火车","count":2,"total_count":29},{"name":"游改","count":2,"total_count"